      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Three failed Sauvé-Kapandji procedures were salvaged using an ulnar head prosthesis. At 7-22 month follow-up, all three patients were much improved. However, the stem of one implant subsequently fractured in a fall and this implant had to be removed."},
